	(text "BenchPod v4 pogo fixture. Passive: the controller (a BenchPod) drives J1.\nJ2: 6 P75 probes in R75 receptacles under the pod's J10 (SWD, NRST, console).\nJ3: 2 probes under the pod's J12 (5 V before the input eFuse, GND).\nThe pod sits on M2.5 standoffs in H1/H2 (its holes H11/H14). H3/H4 are feet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 91.44 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1df5d25a-f019-416a-8863-40966e392145")
	)
